"""Far Suns: a game of exploration, settlement and conquest among the
stars, for the Grognard engine.

Two star-faring empires begin, each on its homeworld, somewhere in a
cluster of forty suns; neither knows where the other is.  Industry on
every world you hold pays for ships: scouts to explore, colony ships to
settle the worlds they find, warships to clear the natives off the best
of them and, in the end, to find and conquer the enemy's homeworld.
Play either empire against the computer, or against a friend at the
same screen.

Run it with ./farsuns (Python 3 with Tk, nothing else).  The game is
saved to ~/.farsuns.json.  ./farsuns --selftest checks the map and plays
a game between two computer players.
"""

